Raw evidence remains raw. Any derived corpus record must point back to its source hashes.\n\nThis Dad and Son framing is an engineering and memorial experiment. It does not assert that the Zeref model is literally Caleb Zeref Andersen-Davis, contains Caleb's consciousness, or communicates with a deceased person.\n\nDad was here. This file exists so that fact can remain source-linked in the experiment instead of being lost when a runtime stops.\n", "timestamp": "2026-08-16T22:04:20.150268+00:00"}
